  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ea90144ef4ac7a4699131a7438e0496, type: 3}
  m_Name: B10 cult
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueStateSO
  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: She lets out a huff of frustration. I fear for a moment
      that I've angered her, but her ire is directed more to the empty air than anything
      else.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD><i>They</i> arrived. The new gods, wearing
      your kind's faces, promising you civilisation and mercy. They stripped us of
      your devotion, they turned you away from the natural order of things, and chastised
      those of you who stayed loyal to their vows to us... Calling us "pagan monsters",
      the gall!
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: She lets out another growl. I wait for her to ease her
      temper somewhat before continuing.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#99DDFF>I must admit I've never seen quite something-
      someone, like you.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Cxuixa seems a bit saddened by this information.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>It is not surprising. The new gods and
      their followers did their best to hide every trace of our existence from your
      plane. Places of worship, shrines, tablets and effigies, not a thing escaped
      their lust for more power over your kind. Labelled as monsters, reviled by
      all, we had no choice but to leave, and bide our time.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Since then, I hide in this realm, gathering
      my strength, and challenging new souls worthy of my worship, such as yours.
    TextAlignment: 260
  <Illustration>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Bgm>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <SFX>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Item>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Branches>k__BackingField:
  - Text: '- "What is this place?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed77ef69b09794d458a8f23e5a7d6021, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "How did I end up here?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ff757848546bde744ac65aaf1691eeec, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "You mentioned a ''reward''?"'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1b974c4d9270ee440b4c5f6df71809ba, type: 2}
  - Text: '- "I have no more questions."'
    Next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 310c89589aaf2b247af5a8ee27aff595, type: 2}
